  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Weapon(Quarterstaff), Grade 1</em></p><p>This acts as a Quarterstaff with the Reach property. You have a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls and on a hit you deal an additional 1d12 lightning damage. If wielded by a creature with Mythical Beast Amber, once per turn they can spend 1 cursed energy as a free action to give the staff a positive charge. As an action, you can release a lightning bolt to the staff if it is within 30 ft of you. All creatures between you and the staff must make a Dexterity saving throw against your Cursed Energy save DC, taking 1d12 lightning damage per charge on a failed save or half as much on a successful save.</p>"
  },
